{
  "declaredLength": 2348,
  "decoding": "confirmed-per-slot-XOR-rotate3-index-seed",
  "format": "GF Trinity encrypted UTF-16 message DAT",
  "initialKey": 0,
  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "哎……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 396,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54CE20262026001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊，<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 412,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF0C00100002010000003002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "怎么了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 436,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "600E4E484E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "叹气了？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53F96C144E86FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "安馨儿可真厉害，\n连烈空坐的事也办好了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B8999A8513F53EF771F53895BB3FF0C000A8FDE70C87A7A575076844E8B4E5F529E597D4E863002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "发生什么事了吗？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 512,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53D1751F4EC04E484E8B4E865417FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "和我说说",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 532,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "548C62118BF48BF40000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "谢谢。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 544,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8C228C223002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我应该告诉过你，\n有个跟我合租房子的朋友<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n通过了事务所的试镜。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 560,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115E948BE5544A8BC98FC74F60FF0C000A67094E2A8DDF6211540879DF623F5B507684670B53CB00100001BE00000A901A8FC74E864E8B52A1624076848BD5955C3002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 39
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且我有个生母不一样的哥哥，\n也就是同父异母的哥哥。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 640,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E14621167094E2A751F6BCD4E0D4E006837768454E554E5FF0C000A4E5F5C31662F540C72365F026BCD768454E554E53002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你哥哥？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 704,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F6054E554E5FF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他是个什么样的人？",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED6662F4E2A4EC04E48683776844EBAFF1F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "他叫提耶鲁诺。\n不过我没见过他，也没和他说过话……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n他也是个表现活跃的舞者。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 736,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4ED653EB63D080369C818BFA3002000A4E0D8FC762116CA189C18FC74ED6FF0C4E5F6CA1548C4ED68BF48FC78BDD2026202600100001BE00000A4ED64E5F662F4E2A886873B06D3B8DC37684821E80053002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 46
    },
    {
      "displayText": "所以，我在想这样下去没问题吗？\n而且感到一种莫名的压力。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 828,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62404EE5FF0C6211572860F38FD968374E0B53BB6CA195EE98985417FF1F000A800C4E14611F52304E0079CD83AB540D7684538B529B3002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 33
    },
    {
      "displayText": "没问题的",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 896,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6CA195EE989876840000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你做好自己就行",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 908,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F60505A597D81EA5DF15C31884C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 8
    },
    {
      "displayText": "很高兴你能这么说，\n不过你是个很厉害的训练家，<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n所以很自然地就能充满自信。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 5,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5F889AD851744F6080FD8FD94E488BF4FF0C000A4E0D8FC74F60662F4E2A5F8853895BB376848BAD7EC35BB6FF0C00100001BE00000A62404EE55F8881EA713657305C3180FD51456EE181EA4FE13002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "这样吧。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 1016,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD9683754273002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 9
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n虽然很突然，但你能和我来场对战吗？<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n如果能打出一场精彩的对战，\n说不定我也能充满自信了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 1036,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A867D71365F887A817136FF0C4F464F6080FD548C62116765573A5BF962185417FF1F00100001BE01000A5982679C80FD625351FA4E00573A7CBE5F6976845BF96218FF0C000A8BF44E0D5B9A62114E5F80FD51456EE181EA4FE14E863002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 58
    },
    {
      "displayText": "那我就在训练场等你哦。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 1152,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "90A362115C3157288BAD7EC3573A7B494F6054E63002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 16
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0014>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 1184,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00140000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n你愿意和我对战了吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 1196,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0010000201000000FF0C000A4F60613F610F548C62115BF962184E865417FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "好啊！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 1240,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "597D554AFF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 4
    },
    {
      "displayText": "稍等一下",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 1248,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "7A0D7B494E004E0B0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "啊～我好紧张。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 1260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "554AFF5E6211597D7D275F203002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "嗯！请多指教！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 1284,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "55EFFF018BF7591A63076559FF01001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001A>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
      "offsetInSection": 1308,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001A0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "宝石海星，\n让对手见识一下像星星一样的光辉！",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 27,
      "offsetInSection": 1320,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "5B9D77F36D77661FFF0C000A8BA95BF9624B89C18BC64E004E0B50CF661F661F4E006837768451498F89FF010000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 23
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+001C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 28,
      "offsetInSection": 1368,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF001C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玳萝！\n你真厉害！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 29,
      "offsetInSection": 1380,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B3841DFF01000A4F60771F53895BB3FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可尔妮！？\n你什么时候来的？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 30,
      "offsetInSection": 1408,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF5C1459AEFF01FF1F000A4F604EC04E4865F6501967657684FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你们刚开始对战，我就来了！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 31,
      "offsetInSection": 1448,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604EEC521A5F0059CB5BF96218FF0C62115C3167654E86FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 18
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，你们俩为什么要对战呢？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 32,
      "offsetInSection": 1484,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C4F604EEC4FE94E3A4EC04E4889815BF962185462FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我最近压力有点大……<U+0010><U+0001>븁\n所以才想到和<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>\n好好打一场，或许就能找到自信。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 8,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 33,
      "offsetInSection": 1524,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "621167008FD1538B529B670970B959272026202600100001BE01000A62404EE5624D60F35230548C0010000201000000000A597D597D62534E00573AFF0C62168BB85C3180FD627E523081EA4FE13002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 45
    },
    {
      "displayText": "玳萝，你很厉害的！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 34,
      "offsetInSection": 1616,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "73B3841DFF0C4F605F8853895BB37684FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 14
    },
    {
      "displayText": "咦？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 35,
      "offsetInSection": 1644,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "54A6FF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 7
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你不是身为超Z队的一员\n救了密阿雷的大家吗？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 36,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F604E0D662F8EAB4E3A8D85005A961F76844E005458000A65514E865BC6963F96F7768459275BB65417FF1F00100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 27
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>只是太强，\n强到离谱而已。<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n玳萝你真的很厉害哦！<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 7,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 37,
      "offsetInSection": 1716,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "001000020100000053EA662F592A5F3AFF0C000A5F3A523079BB8C31800C5DF2300200100001BE00000A73B3841D4F60771F76845F8853895BB354E6FF0100100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 36
    },
    {
      "displayText": "而且你和宝石海星配合默契的舞蹈\n是别人跳不来的。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 38,
      "offsetInSection": 1788,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "800C4E144F60548C5B9D77F36D77661F914D54089ED859517684821E8E48000A662F522B4EBA8DF34E0D67657684300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 29
    },
    {
      "displayText": "可尔妮……<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 39,
      "offsetInSection": 1848,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "53EF5C1459AE20262026001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 10
    },
    {
      "displayText": "我当上继承者的时候\n也像你一样压力很大。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 40,
      "offsetInSection": 1868,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "62115F534E0A7EE7627F8005768465F65019000A4E5F50CF4F604E006837538B529B5F885927300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 25
    },
    {
      "displayText": "毕竟直到现在，关于超级进化\n仍然有太多搞不清的事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 41,
      "offsetInSection": 1920,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "6BD57ADF76F4523073B05728FF0C51734E8E8D857EA78FDB5316000A4ECD71366709592A591A641E4E0D6E0576844E8B300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 30
    },
    {
      "displayText": "因此我身为继承者，\n有时也会烦恼自己究竟能传承什么。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 42,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "56E06B6462118EAB4E3A7EE7627F8005FF0C000A670965F64E5F4F1A70E6607C81EA5DF17A767ADF80FD4F20627F4EC04E48300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 31
    },
    {
      "displayText": "不过，与其烦恼还不如做些能做的事。\n当我想清楚这一点后……<U+0010><U+0001>븀\n就变得积极一些了。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 4,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 43,
      "offsetInSection": 2044,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4E0D8FC7FF0C4E0E517670E6607C8FD84E0D5982505A4E9B80FD505A76844E8B3002000A5F53621160F36E05695A8FD94E0070B9540E2026202600100001BE00000A5C3153D85F9779EF67814E004E9B4E86300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 47
    },
    {
      "displayText": "你说得对。\n可尔妮，谢谢你。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 44,
      "offsetInSection": 2140,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "4F608BF45F975BF93002000A53EF5C1459AEFF0C8C228C224F603002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 19
    },
    {
      "displayText": "还有<U+0010><U+0002>Ā<U+0000>，\n谢谢你总是帮我。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 6,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 45,
      "offsetInSection": 2180,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "8FD867090010000201000000FF0C000A8C228C224F60603B662F5E2E62113002001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 21
    },
    {
      "displayText": "虽然提了一些建议，\n但我也有头疼的事。<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕƒ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 46,
      "offsetInSection": 2224,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "867D713663D04E864E004E9B5EFA8BAEFF0C000A4F4662114E5F6709593475BC76844E8B300200100002011401920000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 24
    },
    {
      "displayText": "是什么样的事？<U+0010><U+0002>Ĕ<U+000C>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 47,
      "offsetInSection": 2272,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "662F4EC04E48683776844E8BFF1F001000020114000C0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
